  "Monterrey is trapped by giant mountains.",
  "The Sierra Madre Oriental ridges surround this massive Mexican industrial hub.",
  "Millions of people live right up against these ancient limestone folds.",
  "A dry riverbed runs through the city center, collecting rare summer rain.",
  "Wildlife thrives on nearby peaks like the 1,500-meter Sierra Las Mitras.",
  "This stunning landscape was captured from space by an astronaut."
